{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "5f31d0d87a3cce0cf31919d4f8f8c1918a48f005ce34de8d4bdec8235e2ff3e5", "ja": "湧き上がる気持ち", "zh": "涌上心头的情感", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d99bdda1c7631183795502cc7e5e52930c166dc22b85f6fed98a8ddbf745d228", "ja": "無事に八幕公演を終えた4人はギターに興味\nを持った育のため楽器店を訪れる。小学生に\n普通のギターは大きいのではないかと心配\nするプロデューサーに、ジュリアは『運命の\n出会いが一番だ』と答え、歌織も納得する。", "zh": "顺利结束八幕公演的4人，为了对吉他产生兴趣的育来到乐器店。面对担心普通吉他对于小学生来说\n会不会太大的制作人，茱莉亚回答道：“最重要的是命运般的\n相遇。”歌织也表示赞同。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d1615799e8d74eb6d5a2b494958a572c3cffbf55d915ed8c52f588a4a4a011b9", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』第八幕は、壮絶な内容を\n演じきったアイドル達への賞賛とともに幕を閉じた）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》第八幕在众人对成功演绎出壮烈剧情的偶像们的赞赏声中落下了帷幕）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "53fad04b40622e7977d57f5525fdeb413fc01307b78c3b695105e499f5dd4c6c", "ja": "（打ち上げの前に、ジュリアの案内で\n楽器店へ行くことになった）", "zh": "（在庆功宴之前，在茱莉亚的带领下，我们决定去乐器店。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "8f0cc037697d29da265d4067f5eacd78d3b6b0105be7c3ef8a0486718d8612ca", "ja": "わあ……！\nこのお店、広～い！　楽器がたくさん！", "zh": "哇啊……！\n这家店好大～啊！有好多乐器！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "1427961183dfa12d116b83ec4c57116e3b6d5dce892db6fa146df3eb3217df03", "ja": "こんなに種類があるんだね！\nはじっこまで、ずっと楽器があるのかな……？", "zh": "原来有这么多种类啊！\n一直到最里面，都摆满了乐器吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "8f46add4a63f6facd51a645b7b4ba440a554565e037b1cd3650f3b9bc9376b60", "ja": "育、いってみよう！", "zh": "育，我们去看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a9d10aa70a142c15e790340becd96435227169b45ca7c79ec33277296c93d88b", "ja": "探検はいいけど、\n走っちゃダメだぞ、ふたりとも！", "zh": "探险可以，但你们两个不许跑哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8d2b7c4ddf104bf2cb3c9f7ff12f4615a4ec40dc3a0a631eb754dc92f219a50c", "ja": "ジュリア、店に来たはいいけど、\n環や育のサイズに合うギターってあるのか？", "zh": "茱莉亚，来店是来了，可有适合环和育身材的吉他吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "d2e04595af57e96912a40b8ee2fe8e0144020714975c2488b13a0336abe5dd92", "ja": "小学生用はあるけど……でも、いいんじゃないか？\n体よりでかいやつでも、めちゃくちゃ高いやつでも。", "zh": "小学生用的倒是有……不过，哪怕是比身体还大的琴，\n或者是贵得要命的琴，不也挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "fff6ed388a9546318842fbc64749f442ca62af707b8e60d6062d7dfd0bfa5e48", "ja": "そうなの？\nでも、弾けなかったら……。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n可是，要是弹不了的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "29078f4494b405bbc8a0dedd4cc61a0535d3347b141294b74874c5e9dafce2f0", "ja": "実際に弾けるとかよりも……なんつーか、\nまずギターにたくさん出会ってほしいと思ってさ。", "zh": "比起能不能真的弹出来……怎么说呢，\n我是想先让你多接触接触各种各样的吉他。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "a7058a314282ca1c0686ffad5ca03cd0188f9e5359bddac45c61bc6a05a82976", "ja": "『こいつをいつか弾いてみたい！』……って思う\n運命の出会いがあれば、それが一番だろ？", "zh": "能有一次让你觉得“总有一天想弹响这家伙！”……\n的命中注定的相遇，那就是最棒的了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "aaf9b21ff416da8136b5a3692e8495489e454465ed7b572e4830aecdda75581d", "ja": "運命の出会い……。", "zh": "命运般的相遇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "a679d86d3ea110b1419c2dc96ffa0459b82cd8fcb85b73758967e4e2be8dd1c0", "ja": "それさえあれば、他はなんとかなるだろ？\n体はいずれ大きくなるし。", "zh": "只要有那个，其他的总会有办法的吧？身体总会慢慢长大的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "9acc1ab45a3f8a0feb9356cf6b21b8a8d672fc855ee27091b87937b30f579f7a", "ja": "でも、心から湧き上がる気持ちは、本人達次第だ。\nまずはそれがあるかどうか、だな。", "zh": "不过，那些从心底涌起的感情，还是取决于她们自己。\n首先得看她们有没有这样的感情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "a7e786a68976ac0dfb9f835b9cf3f8693ae01bce50ebb1d64e3e02ac44982435", "ja": "そう……そうね。\nそんな出会いがあったら、とっても素敵ね。", "zh": "是啊……是呢。\n如果能遇到那样的机会，一定很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "e79f4568dcae5bcbf7c06b4afd52ad55e4aad8dd33d2e312f5b1458432fa39a6", "ja": "ねえねえ、みんなー！　あっちに\nボコボコのUFOみたいな楽器があった～！", "zh": "喂喂，大家——！那边有个坑坑洼洼的UFO一样的乐器～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "8538e94e87d0ce5e7f9559dfc4abbafc138487fbcea9f1f64b0a9c890b436745", "ja": "でも、叩くととってもやさしい音色なの！\nすごいよね！？", "zh": "但是，敲起来却是非常温柔的音色！\n很厉害吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "445af222ec9ddca60b64a6d73a260739373545130a184b64ec0dee797c2662e5", "ja": "おいおい。ふたりとも、\nギターを見に来たんじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "喂喂，你们两个不是来看吉他的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "eee56d7296dac722ade85452a49e3cb8f6d196640cebc8673c702ea2ffd48100", "ja": "まあまあ、ジュリア。\n時間はあるし、ゆっくり見て回ろう。", "zh": "好啦好啦，茱莉亚。\n时间还很充裕，慢慢逛着看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "62605b7e3fd6e7c461303b7ab35611a2e297791e6a5be00932539a29aff9d1b4", "ja": "ま、それもそうだな。……環、育。\nその楽器、あたしも気になる！　行こう！", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。……环、育。\n我也对那件乐器很感兴趣！走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "eea5929e799bb6f3af6abc88d6a2f4b2fab89ab2e23bf365242fc5027ed85bfd", "ja": "（次は『STARDOM ROAD』最終幕……\nみんなで繋げてきた舞台の終着点だ）", "zh": "（接下来是《STARDOM ROAD》的最终幕……是大家一路携手走来的舞台终点）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0365_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "5f90fe7a3dac228874162d63d41a5923e80b74752cf65a34b03d6e9f6e945ac5", "ja": "（迷うことはもうない。物語の結末に向けて、\nアイドル達と最後まで駆け抜けよう！）", "zh": "（已经不会再迷茫了。朝着故事的结局，\n和偶像们一起一路冲刺到最后吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
